49+00:00","Message":"core: move cross-spawn-spawner from opencode to core package\n\nMoved the cross-spawn-spawner module from packages/opencode to packages/core\nto enable code sharing across the monorepo. This consolidates the process\nspawning infrastructure into the core package so other packages can use\ncross-platform child process spawning without duplicating the implementation.\n\nUpdated all import statements across the codebase to reference the new\nlocation (@opencode-ai/core/effect/cross-spawn-spawner). Removed the\nlocal copy from the opencode package along with its tests."},{"Sha":"ff4b60e1f3d2ad83a74785443dd041ed4e7814bf","Login":"opencode-agent[bot]","IsBot":true,"AuthorName":"opencode-agent[bot]","AuthorEmail":"opencode-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-04-25T18:14:26+00:00","Message":"chore: generate"},{"Sha":"f91b73b9388106205f5cbefca3d79c44a301df5a","Login":"rekram1-node","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Aiden Cline","AuthorEmail":"aidenpcline@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-25T18:13:19+00:00","Message":"ci: fix model name"},{"Sha":"05661c60ffb1ce1bde844f3a6aa5b6cb5bc22412","Login":"kitlangton","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kit Langton","AuthorEmail":"kit.langton@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-25T18:12:54+00:00","Message":"feat(httpapi): bridge file search endpoints (#24356)"},{"Sha":"625aca49de2325c29189c6ac6ec5a49efc7e9450","Login":"kitlangton","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kit Langton","AuthorEmail":"kit.langton@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-25T18:10:58+00:00","Message":"feat(tui): read Zed editor context from state db (#24352)"},{"Sha":"3bc0c36acec47aa7ff1278bb222e1224e56641e8","Login":"opencode-agent[bot]","IsBot":true,"AuthorName":"opencode-agent[bot]","AuthorEmail":"opencode-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-04-25T18:01:35+00:00","Message":"chore: generate"},{"Sha":"eb0219988b3696edd67a1b1e076268c7d50f1b47","Login":"kitlangton","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Kit Langton","AuthorEmail":"kit.langton@gmail.com","Date":"2026-04-25T18:00:30+00:00","Message":"feat(httpapi): bridge catalog read endpoints (#24353)"},{"Sha":"705f792e87ac695b64879cda18f2f18d3ace68e3","Login":"thdxr","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Dax Raad","AuthorEmail":"d@ironbay.co","Date":"2026-04-25T17:51:37+00:00","Message":"core: move Global module to @opencode-ai/core for centralized path management\n\nMove the Global module from packages/opencode/src/global to packages/core/src/global\nto provide a unified location for managing XDG directories and application paths.\nThis eliminates duplicate path definitions across packages and ensures consistent\naccess to data, config, cache, state, log, and bin directories throughout the codebase."},{"Sha":"716cf741906db40f07c1aa462001f650370f0093","Login":"rekram1-node","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Aiden Cline","AuthorEmail":"63023139\u002Brekram1-node@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-04-25T17:52:19+00:00","Message":"ci: adjust review flow (#24355)"},{"Sha":"fc8dae24229c13947a963d4bd69d1d47c26d89cc","Login":"opencode-agent[bot]","IsBot":true,"AuthorName":"opencode-agent[bot]","AuthorEmail":"opencode-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-04-25T17:50:26+00:00","Message":"chore: update nix node_modules hashes"},{"Sha":"27353df0cc08eab143e5024c6d8fe25577293884","Login":"opencode-agent[bot]","IsBot":true,"AuthorName":"opencode-agent[bot]","AuthorEmail":"opencode-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-04-25T17:31:57+00:00","Message":"chore: generate"},{"Sha":"1a734adb4d1ce6071432bd68ac45fa4457f0dc2e","Login":"thdxr","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Dax Raad","AuthorEmail":"d@ironbay.co","Date":"2026-04-25T17:29:52+00:00","Message":"core: consolidate shared infrastructure into core package\n\nMoves effect logging, observability, runtime utilities, flags, installation\nversion info, and process utilities from opencode to core package. This\nenables better code sharing across packages and establishes core as the\nsingle source of truth for foundational utilities.\n\nAll internal